# AI agent shared dirs, pre-created so no single stow package owns them.
# Paths are relative to $HOME.
#
# Only the dirs this repo's packages link into. Other dotfiles repos list the
# dirs they need themselves (eg ~/.agents/skills, ~/.claude/rules). Each agent
# keeps its own state (auth, history, sessions, caches) in its home dir, so
# those must stay real dirs rather than symlinks into a dotfiles repo; the
# agent packages only link files into them.

# ~/.agents: the agentsstandard.com dir. This repo adds hooks/; other repos
# add AGENTS.md and skills.
.agents

# Claude Code.
.claude

# Codex. The codex package links hooks.json into it.
.codex

# pi. extensions/ is shared with herdr's pi integration, which installs its
# own file there.
.pi
.pi/agent
.pi/agent/extensions

# opencode. plugins/ is shared with herdr's opencode integration, which
# installs its own file there.
.config/opencode
.config/opencode/plugins
